## Open-source foundation attribution

The agent loop in `apps/api/src/agentforge/agent/loop.py` (~280 lines)
adapts patterns from the OpenHands CodeAct agent design
(https://github.com/All-Hands-AI/OpenHands, commit
`3515cb085834623d9d0ef9d6977d1bcfa2b6eb57`, MIT-licensed). No OpenHands
code was imported, vendored, or copied; the action/observation model,
event-stream-driven state, and bounded loop with explicit termination
were studied and reimplemented in a minimal form. The full attribution
appears in `README.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md` §4, and
`docs/adr/0001-open-source-foundation.md`.

OpenHands is licensed MIT (https://github.com/All-Hands-AI/OpenHands/blob/main/LICENSE).
